---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout title="Wings documentation">
  <h1>Wings Guide</h1>
  <p>EcliPanel uses patched <strong>wings-rs</strong> and not legacy wings-go.</p>

  <h2>Directory model</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Path</th><th>Use</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>wings/source</code></td><td>Clean upstream source</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>wings/patched</code></td><td>Where you edit code</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>wings/patches</code></td><td>Generated patch files</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>wings/output</code></td><td>Patched build workspace</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Patch + build flow</h2>
  <pre><code>cd /opt/EcliPanel/wings
./manage.sh regen
./manage.sh patch
./manage.sh build</code></pre>

  <h2>Deploy binary</h2>
  <pre><code>curl -fsSL https://backend.example.com/api/wings/download -o /usr/local/bin/wings
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/wings
systemctl restart wings</code></pre>

  <h2>Security endpoints available in patched Wings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>/api/servers/:id/security/processes</code></li>
    <li><code>/api/servers/:id/security/connections</code></li>
    <li><code>/api/servers/:id/security/scan-files</code></li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
